cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this prototype, cite the repository."
title: "PreFlight: Independent Cloud-Readiness Review for Guidewire-Style Estates"
authors:
  - family-names: Singh
    given-names: Saundarya
year: 2026
version: 1.0.0
url: "https://github.com/SaundaryaSingh/Preflight-CloudMigration"
license: MIT
type: software
abstract: >-
  An offline, evidence-first review workstation for Guidewire-style legacy
  policy administration estates. It assembles feature candidates across PCF,
  entity metadata, typelists, extracted templates, Gosu, and Cloud API
  configuration; links claims to file evidence; surfaces documented blockers
  and gaps; and produces a reviewable local Cloud API extension draft with an
  impact-rated assumption register for one feature slice.
